## Objective
Implement backend search functionality for ads by text and category, including tests and required files.

## Important Details
- Task involves creating three files: `search_ads.py`, `search.py`, and `search.py` (routes).
- Tests must be written using `pytest` and mock database calls.
- The implementation must handle text search and optional category filtering.
- Database columns: `id`, `usuario_id`, `categoria_id`, `titulo`, `descripcion`, `precio_centavos`.
- Tests expect `precio_centavos` instead of `precio`.
- Tests expect no `fecha_creacion` sorting.
- File paths: `backend/app/datos/search_ads.py`, `backend/app/servicios/search.py`, `backend/app/rutas/search.py`.

